  "body": "The boat is sold, the vendor is downsizing, and it's time to move on! Bring your own boat or explore the opportunity to generate a rental return from the exclusive 13.5m marina berth.\r\n\r\nImagine waking up to tranquil marina views, stepping directly from your home onto your boat, entertaining friends on the waterfront and even watching the orcas that are known to visit.\r\n\r\n* A Lifestyle Made for Summer\r\n* Exclusive 13.5m marina berth directly in front\r\n* Spacious 180sqm ground-floor residence\r\n* Four generous bedrooms\r\n* Three bathrooms plus additional guest facilities\r\n* Two bedrooms with ensuites\r\n* Private sauna and spa\r\n* Expansive open-plan living and dining\r\n* Waterfront garden and outdoor entertaining\r\n* Double garaging plus storage\r\n* Easy single-level, lock-and-leave living\r\n* Apartment and marina berth offer rental flexibility\r\n\r\nEnjoy waterfront cafés, restaurants, beautiful beaches, coastal walkways and the spectacular Shakespear Regional Park. With the Hauraki Gulf as your playground, spend your days fishing, boating, exploring nearby islands or simply relaxing in your own waterfront sanctuary.\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking a permanent residence, a holiday retreat or an investment opportunity, this exceptional property offers lifestyle, space and income potential.   The vendor's plans are in motion - now it's your turn!\r\n\r\nBring your boat or enjoy the potential rental return from your marina berth while embracing everything waterfront living has to offer.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity - contact me TODAY to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view/download files on the property copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/DT69",
